	(text "04 Measurement (IF-2.2, fourth pass): the loop's six channels on dedicated ADS7056 converters, sampled together on CS_FAST (timed by the control board's PWM generator: mid high-side conduction for V and I_C, mid low-side for I_Q), fast front ends (OPA2836, <= 50 ns), 3.0 V reference REF3030 as their AVDD; the AD7689 keeps all eight channels as slow monitors (external 3.0 V reference). Channel order IN0..7 = interfaces.md 9."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 17.78 0)
