	(text "Current amplifiers: out = 1.5 V + 0.34 V/A (50 mOhm, gain 6.8, +-4.4 A full scale); forward (freewheeling) current in the low-side shunt and a discharging capacitor read below 1.5 V. Kelvin taps at the shunts (layout). The comparators (sheet 05) and the AD7689 take the same amplifier outputs through 100 ohm / 2.7 nF."
